WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:03.420
He knew that it would turn out this way
and headed over there.

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:04.671
What for?

00:00:05.255 --> 00:00:07.090
I don't know the details.

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:12.303
But he was looking into something
and found the 'answer' as he calls it.

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:16.433
And he headed out to the scene
for his 'confirmation' like always.

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:18.393
Knowing it was possible he could

00:00:18.476 --> 00:00:20.395
be kidnapped during his 'confirmation'.

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:24.399
He should've said something.

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:28.820
He says useless stuff like
he needs to poop or has diarrhea

00:00:28.903 --> 00:00:31.740
or constipation,
but never says urgent things.

00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:32.949
Ms. Lily?

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:37.162
That guy never believes anything
unless he sees it with his own eyes.

00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:40.457
He’s smart, but he doesn’t have
the mentality of someone who is.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:44.502
His personality is like a nasty
and stupid fifth grader.

00:00:44.586 --> 00:00:46.421
No, third grader!

00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:50.467
Seriously, I hope he gets his guts
eaten clean and dies!

00:00:51.926 --> 00:00:54.929
Your vocabulary for slander is impressive.

00:00:55.305 --> 00:00:59.726
Anyway, we have no choice
but to follow the traces.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:43.520
It's not moldy.
Just as I thought, it's here.

00:01:57.575 --> 00:02:00.495
For now, let’s look around
and take things with us.

00:02:00.537 --> 00:02:01.746
Got it.

00:02:02.163 --> 00:02:03.331
Huh?

00:02:08.086 --> 00:02:09.796
Hey, take a look at this.

00:02:10.505 --> 00:02:12.757
Is this you, Koku?

00:02:12.882 --> 00:02:14.551
Ah, yes.

00:02:14.676 --> 00:02:16.344
So cute.

00:02:17.178 --> 00:02:18.930
This is Yuna, right?

00:02:21.182 --> 00:02:22.058
Hm?

00:02:23.393 --> 00:02:25.436
This is Kirisame.

00:02:29.023 --> 00:02:31.860
I wonder what this kid
Kirisame wants to do?

00:02:32.068 --> 00:02:35.822
There's no meaning to any of this.
He's only doing tedious things.

00:02:36.698 --> 00:02:39.784
If we wants to kill the King,
he should just do it.

00:02:40.201 --> 00:02:43.580
I don’t understand the meaning
behind involving you or Keith in this.

00:02:43.705 --> 00:02:46.249
He’s just adding in extra elements.

00:02:46.374 --> 00:02:49.377
He’s endangering his own plan.

00:02:50.044 --> 00:02:51.880
I don't get it at all.

00:02:51.963 --> 00:02:54.841
I don't think the ‘King’s Life’
is his objective.

00:02:54.924 --> 00:02:55.800
Huh?

00:02:57.302 --> 00:03:00.930
I think his aim
is to make me kill the King.

